  "description": "In dirt we trust!\nFor years we have been the leaders of the dirt jump scene with our Movement bike range. Build around a frame that has the same geometry and specs as the Crankworx winning Decade, the Movement will meet the expectations of the most demanding riders.\nToday, this legend is back, this time with refreshed specs, including a rotor-ready head tube and built in chain tensioners – a feature that will take away the headaches of aligning the rear wheel.\nTough and light alloy frame Brand new tensioners to keep your rear wheel in place on big slams! Rotor-ready head tube Marzocchi Bomber Z2, 100mm travel, 15mm thru axle, Air spring Beefier tyres: blast through dirt jumps and without worrying about washing out!",
